n the disabled-GH test would be redundant with existing coverage, not a gap-closing measure. No consumers depend on exact summary strings as a stable interface."}]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"c504e88b-b6b8-4bb9-a336-457a5018ed3d"}
